        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The chart shows export values of one country by category for 2015-2016. The table shows percentage changes between these years. Summarise the main features and make comparisons.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The chart shows export values of one country by category for 2015-2016. The table shows percentage changes between these years. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarise the main features and make comparisons.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task 1 - Export Values by Category: 2015&ndash;2016</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJIDd23oMoldbUxAfnilBuFRgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>Đề b&agrave;i cho 1 bar chart v&agrave; 1 table, y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>[Bar Chart]</strong> Thể hiện doanh thu xuất khẩu của một quốc gia qua 5 nh&oacute;m sản phẩm trong 2015 v&agrave; 2016</p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FH3wdWJgyo30uTxAx2hlOFb2gXd\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>[Table] </strong>Thể hiện tỷ lệ phần trăm thay đổi của từng nh&oacute;m trong giai đoạn n&agrave;y</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJIDd23oMoldbUxAfnilBuFRgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a class=\"underline\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=4\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối'</a> &amp; paraphrase</span></strong> cho dữ liệu số tiền, v&agrave; <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a class=\"underline\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=5\">tả số liệu 'tương đối'</a></strong></span> cho dữ liệu phần trăm trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZpIdw4P3osddmxIMZ9li0rYgSb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vk4KdFNhto3OExxtSVUlVPdpgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Bar Chart]:</strong> Doanh thu xuất khẩu của 5 nh&oacute;m sản phẩm trong 2015-2016 (t&iacute;nh bằng tỷ USD)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z9DedtIfLosHpkxNc8jlzuW4gle\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Table]:</strong> Tỷ lệ phần trăm thay đổi gi&aacute; trị xuất khẩu của từng nh&oacute;m giữa hai năm n&agrave;y</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUnaddQgFoFLRQxlWaGltaJzgNf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng Mixed Charts, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Doanh thu xuất khẩu tăng ở 4 trong 5 nh&oacute;m từ 2015 đến 2016, chỉ c&oacute; gems and jewellery trải qua sự suy giảm</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Petroleum products li&ecirc;n tục tạo ra doanh thu cao nhất, trong khi textiles ghi nhận tỷ lệ tăng trưởng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất với hơn 15%</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEy0dSCZ9o7y8xx1gJflkyMZg5f\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Bar Chart&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwmzdoITYoJYcDxTNRMlJcpRg1b\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UTwOdw4dGoaibBxQJxdlw0IHg1d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả petroleum products - thống lĩnh doanh thu</strong> <em>(khoảng 60 tỷ năm 2015, tăng l&ecirc;n khoảng 62 tỷ năm 2016)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvN9duQjno6xJDxs7G7lczIogVc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả engineered goods v&agrave; gems and jewellery - nh&oacute;m trung b&igrave;nh</strong> <em>(engineered goods: khoảng 57 tỷ tăng l&ecirc;n 60 tỷ, gems and jewellery: 42 tỷ giảm xuống 39 tỷ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvN9duQjno6xJDxs7G7lczIogVc\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả agricultural products v&agrave; textiles - c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m c&oacute; doanh thu thấp hơn</strong> <em>(agricultural: duy tr&igrave; ổn định khoảng 30 tỷ cả hai năm, textiles: tăng từ 25 l&ecirc;n khoảng 31 tỷ)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CWYVdQnVFoYYX4xAr4VlBPU3gpf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Table&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LL3RdSvTvoxq3yxxhYblMZxkggf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YSkCdvJ7rojXGCx8wUblzVRTg4f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả textiles v&agrave; engineered goods - tăng trưởng mạnh</strong>&nbsp;<em>(15.24% v&agrave; 8.5%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IruFd9ykUoteDcxDOeplmMvbgkf\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả petroleum products v&agrave; agricultural products - tăng khi&ecirc;m tốn </strong><em>(3% v&agrave; 0.81%)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IruFd9ykUoteDcxDOeplmMvbgkf\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3)<strong> M&ocirc; tả gems and jewellery - nh&oacute;m duy nhất thu hẹp&nbsp;</strong><em>(giảm 5.18%)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2d1dx8ZuovlHTxVLYllnpIZgNe\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>thống lĩnh/dẫn đầu</strong>\", ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c cụm sau để đa dạng c&aacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">dominate STH</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">consistently generate the highest</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CJO9dKcXGohw4lx6d4flvkTYgug\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yofxdy3PtoKLK9xL9MGlRL1KgkP\">Petroleum products <strong>dominated</strong> export earnings in both years, generating approximately 60 billion dollars in 2015 and rising to roughly 62 billion in 2016.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1391,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The bar chart illustrates the export earnings of a country across five product categories in 2015 and 2016, while the accompanying table presents the percentage changes in each category during this period.</p>",
            "question_id": 17619,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1392,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, export revenues increased in four out of five categories between 2015 and 2016, with only gems and jewellery experiencing a decline. Additionally, petroleum products consistently generated the highest earnings, while textiles recorded the most significant growth rate at over 15%.</p>",
            "question_id": 17619,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1393,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at the absolute values, petroleum products dominated export earnings in both years, generating approximately 60 billion dollars in 2015 and rising to roughly 62 billion in 2016. Engineered goods ranked second, earning around 57 billion dollars in 2015 and increasing to about 60 billion the following year. Gems and jewellery started at approximately 42 billion dollars in 2015 but declined to around 39 billion in 2016. The remaining categories, agricultural products and textiles, showed lower earnings, with agricultural products maintaining steady figures of about 30 billion dollars in both years, while textiles rose from 25 billion to approximately 31 billion dollars.</p>",
            "question_id": 17619,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1394,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the percentage changes shown in the table, textiles experienced the most dramatic growth at 15.24%, followed by engineered goods with an 8.5% increase. Petroleum products recorded a modest rise of 3%, while agricultural products showed minimal growth of just 0.81%. Conversely, gems and jewellery was the only sector to contract, declining by 5.18% over the period.</p>",
            "question_id": 17619,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
